      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chief_Lackey_Rich\" data-post=\"6\" data-topic=\"30600\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Chief_Lackey_Rich:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>They were nice enough to share their transformation formula after extracting a promise not to tell anyone they existed.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>And yet, you just told us… oh, how quickly a hero falls.</p>",
